namespace pdg { /**

\class pdg::AnimationContactTarget
\ingroup Animation Physics
\brief World and platform contact locks with timed release.

Preserves a contact point in owning-layer coordinates. lockWorld() holds a fixed
point; lockPlatform() follows a support identified by the application. update()
checks the supplied contact/reach policy and advances release fades in seconds.

The helper starts unlocked and never reacquires automatically. Call a lock method
on a confirmed contact edge. getState() returns an independent copy of the point,
influence, and lock flag.

\see lockWorld(), lockPlatform(), update(), \ref animation_target_adapters

**/ }
